                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f18839c4-8cba-4a34-9757-a8babb128985",
                        "entry_id": "b90815cb-1633-3449-b50a-d5c807521031",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "shippiest"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e36aca6e-b41d-3f50-80cd-c8eb2132dc35",
                        "entry_id": "b90815cb-1633-3449-b50a-d5c807521031",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Related to or characteristic of a ship (vessel)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45840f31-fb67-4f72-8671-a2ce50c54b55",
                                "sense_id": "e36aca6e-b41d-3f50-80cd-c8eb2132dc35",
                                "text": "Well, we have been here since Mid-June, beside a reefy and shippy shore, with sails by day and lamps by night, all over the water, and a sunrise and sunset gun from an obsolete fort across the harbor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4868efe5-9cf9-4b19-9385-09e5584ef378",
                                "sense_id": "e36aca6e-b41d-3f50-80cd-c8eb2132dc35",
                                "text": "About the interior decorations, however, there was nothing shippy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f794769f-cff7-496e-b81a-4f36d3174f71",
                                "sense_id": "e36aca6e-b41d-3f50-80cd-c8eb2132dc35",
                                "text": "[…] there were always vehicles parked there, and anyone driving by will think we're just tourists gawping at all the shippy stuff."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "80c1937b-f95c-31aa-b146-9ab1d9c3cefa",
                        "entry_id": "b90815cb-1633-3449-b50a-d5c807521031",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Related to, characteristic of, or supporting a romantic relationship (ship) between characters."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3731991-d79c-414a-81d5-6d1231b07f1e",
                                "sense_id": "80c1937b-f95c-31aa-b146-9ab1d9c3cefa",
                                "text": "Anyway, the shippy moment comes when Scully (who's noticeably pregnant) and Mulder are talking on the park bench."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65f79aee-a145-42e0-ab30-d4be8b52adba",
                                "sense_id": "80c1937b-f95c-31aa-b146-9ab1d9c3cefa",
                                "text": "One thing that can be inferred is that \"Ghosts\", a very shippy episode, apparently didn't scare (pun intended) any viewers away."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1468aa5e-8de6-4e0a-9166-9b64cb59deaa",
                                "sense_id": "80c1937b-f95c-31aa-b146-9ab1d9c3cefa",
                                "text": "i agree. even if it's just a couple of moments of bliss, my shippy heart will be content."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
